This licence covers the source code, documentation and figures in this
repository. It does NOT relicense the Earth-observation data the pipeline
reads, the derived numbers it reports, or the OSM-derived context layers it
publishes:

  * NISAR L2 GUNW products: NASA/JPL-Caltech, distributed by the Alaska
    Satellite Facility DAAC under NASA Earthdata terms of use.
  * Sentinel-1 products (when the C-band path is used): ESA Copernicus,
    free and open under the Copernicus data policy.
  * OSM-derived context layers (data/processed/<case>/context_layers.geojson and
    config/context/<case>.json): a Derivative Database, © OpenStreetMap
    contributors, offered under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/ . The MIT grant above does not
    apply to these files. A rendered map, screenshot or figure is a Produced
    Work and needs only the attribution notice.

See "Licence & attribution" in README.md for citation guidance.
